    <description>HomeBank is a free software (as in "free speech" and also as in "free beer") that will assist you to manage your personal accounting.
It is designed to easy to use and be able to analyse your personal finance and budget in detail using powerful filtering tools and beautiful charts.
If you are looking for a completely free and easy application to manage your personal accounting, budget, finance then HomeBank should be the software of choice.

**Please Note**: This is an automatically updated package. If you find it is out of date by more than a day or two, please contact the maintainer(s) and let them know the package is no longer updating correctly.</description>
    <summary>Free personal finance, Free money management, Free personal accounting.</summary>
    <releaseNotes>
Made 5.10.4 release
* change: scheduled list, default columns consistent when → who/what → how much
* change: scheduled list, merged Late+Still columns to Late/Left
* change: scheduled list, overdue is in clear text without redundant icon
* change: scheduled list, recurrence column title and removed useless icon
* change: scheduled list, moved totals below the list, always visible
* change: scheduled/templates window added a switcher
* bugfix: fix for #[2111786](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2111786) was not completely working
* bugfix: preference last selected page was not reminded
* bugfix: date entry tooltip was incorrect for year (ctrl + shift)
* bugfix: transaction sign warning faultly show when no amount
* bugfix: transaction window weird display tags widget with some themes
* bugfix: #[2172606](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2172606) using a template for a new transaction faultly reset date
* bugfix: #[2172430](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2172430) "Copy clipboard" option could be enriched/clarified
* bugfix: #[2172419](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2172419) category remains after later add splits to a transaction
* bugfix: #[2172206](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2172206) "Include Transfer" in Budget Options not persistent across app restarts
* bugfix: #[2172195](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2172195) global Balance forecast for Next Year doesn't work
* bugfix: #[2169732](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2169732) split dialog amount focus and select-all
* bugfix: #[2169055](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2169055) crash when adding the final balancing line to a split transaction
* bugfix: #[2168280](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2168280) balance report printout ellipsize large numbers
* bugfix: #[2167975](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2167975) missing icon to apply changes in the split transaction editing dialog
* bugfix: #[2167520](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2167520) all templates are displayed in the dropdown for the ADD dialog

**Full changelog:** [https://www.gethomebank.org/ChangeLog](https://www.gethomebank.org/ChangeLog)</releaseNotes>
